  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening Private Sect. Engagmnt in Ent. Dev. in N. Uganda &amp; Karamoja(SPEED) - Strengthening Private Sector Engagement in Enterpr</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Strengthening Private Sect. Engagmnt in Ent. Dev. in N. Uganda &amp; Karamoja(SPEED)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased incomes in high growth sectors through inclusive market development for 114,055 farmers and traders in Northern Uganda and Karamoja</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">M&#xe5;let &#xe4;r &#xf6;kade inkomster i tillv&#xe4;xtsektorer genom inkluderande        marknadsutvecklings&#xe5;tg&#xe4;rder. Det ska uppn&#xe5;s genom st&#xf6;d till insatser  f&#xf6;r f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrat f&#xf6;retagsklimat, h&#xf6;gre jordbruksproduktivitet och       produktiv syssels&#xe4;ttning med s&#xe4;rskilt fokus p&#xe5; kvinnors och ungdomars behov och f&#xf6;ruts&#xe4;ttningar i Karamoja och Norra Uganda.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is increased incomes in high growth sectors through     inclusive market development by supporting measures that strenghten   the business environment, agricultural productivity, private sector   partnerships, and productive employment. The programme specifically   focuses on the needs and conditions of women and youth in Karamoja    (four districts) and Northern Uganda (two districts).</narrative>
  </description>
